jor priority, indicating potential risk areas that need immediate attention.\n\n**Recommendation**:\n- Prioritize resolving Major priority issues to mitigate risks.\n- Regularly review and adjust priorities based on business impact.\n\n### 6. Overall Team Capacity and Workload Balance\n- **Open Issues Total**: 1297\n\n**Insight**: The high number of open issues suggests potential capacity constraints and workload imbalance.\n\n**Recommendation**:\n- Assess team capacity and consider hiring or redistributing tasks to balance the workload.\n- Implement regular workload reviews to ensure sustainable team performance.\n\n## General Recommendations\n- **Process Improvement**: Conduct a root cause analysis to identify inefficiencies in the ticket resolution process.\n- **Resource Management**: Consider strategic hiring or training to enhance team capacity and capability.\n- **Monitoring and Reporting**: Establish regular reporting on key metrics to facilitate proactive management of workload and resource allocation."
